# Files in this repo that are working material, not part of the public site.
# Vercel leaves these out of the deployment. Patterns follow .gitignore syntax;
# a leading "/" anchors a pattern to the repo root so it cannot match a
# same-named file deeper in the tree. After changing this file, check a preview
# deploy: /CLAUDE.md must return 404.
#
# Check what a pattern removes before adding it:
#   git ls-files -ci --exclude-from=.vercelignore
#   python3 scripts/check_deploy_refs.py      (no public page may load an ignored file)

# Agent and product notes
/CLAUDE.md
/PRODUCT.md
/DESIGN.md

# Design previews, drafts and QA screenshots
/homepage-redesign.html
/blog-ad-preview.html
/popup-preview.html
/preview-subtext-styles.html
/scrolling-reveal-preview.html
/email-signature.html
/hero-previews/
/professionals/preview.html
/professionals/qa-*.png

# HTML templates used to render blog images. The rendered .png/.webp files
# next to them stay published because posts load them.
/blog/images/*.html

# Repo tooling
/scripts/

# Working asset folders. No public page, stylesheet or script loads from these
# (checked 4 Nov 2026), and no n8n workflow uses "Images for n8n" (Stephen, 4 Nov 2026).
/Images for n8n/
/social-templates/
/social-assets/
/social-images/
/video-templates/
/video-assets/
/reels/
/email-signatures/
/scrolling-reveal/
/18 birdies brand/
/Scoring Zone for Professional Coaches/

# Must stay published, do not add:
#   /Scrolling Reveal/   /professionals/ loads its phone screenshots
#   /email-assets/       emails already sent load their images from it
#   /Featured images/, /Putting images/, /short-game-practice/, /social-proof/, /audio/
#                        loaded by live pages
